    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/9fcdb094e82cb1ac91ce67a0d3c2c094.avif?t=1752041458\" /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/ff655090d5511fdb8b5667f0fd912260.avif?t=1752041458\" /></span><br><br><strong>As One We Survive</strong> is a <strong>top-down survival game</strong> set in a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> America. Step into the shoes of a father as he tries to find help for his sick daughter during a grid down post-pandemic event. <strong>Fight, scavenge, craft, and gather resources</strong> for your family's survival. <br><br>Using a <strong>unique blend of survival and colony management mechanics</strong>, you will have to form a community both to survive and find help for your daughter. <strong>Build and manage your community</strong>, protect your people from danger, and make tough decisions that will determine the fate of your group in a harsh and unforgiving world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.poster.avif?t=1752041458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.webm?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.mp4?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    <strong>Challenging Survival:</strong> Scavenge, craft, and outsmart the harsh wilderness in a dangerous world with scarce resources.<br></li><li>    <strong>Unforgiving Combat:</strong> No health packs; use bandages to stop bleeding, sleep to heal injuries, and maintain weapons for reliability.<br></li><li>    <strong>Community Management:</strong> Join a survivor community, upgrade your base with  facilities, and create renewable resources to support your people.<br></li><li>    <strong>NPC Companions</strong>: Form bonds with fellow survivors while scavenging for vital supplies and getting to know your community.<br></li><li>    <strong>Skill Progression:</strong> Hone survival skills in the wilderness, improve with every challenge, and master the art of survival.<br></li><li>    <strong>Two Modes Of Play:</strong> Story and Survival. Experience a narrative in Story mode, then test your skills in the post-apocalyptic world alone or with a companion.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.poster.avif?t=1752041458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.webm?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.mp4?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/8600ab9d0b28be5752ea4fde52a9f86b.avif?t=1752041458\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    <strong>Form a Community:</strong> Recruit survivors to create a safe haven.<br></li><li>    <strong>Supply Runs:</strong> Gather food, water, and medicine for survival.<br></li><li>    <strong>Building and Resources:</strong> Construct facilities, create renewable resources.<br></li><li>    <strong>Uncover Missions:</strong> Get intel from recruits, advance the story to help your daughter.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.poster.avif?t=1752041458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.webm?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d821b5be26c5.mp4?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/ff655090d5511fdb8b5667f0fd912260.avif?t=1752041458\" /></span><br><br><strong>As One We Survive</strong> is a <strong>top-down survival game</strong> set in a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> America. Step into the shoes of a father as he tries to find help for his sick daughter during a grid down post-pandemic event. <strong>Fight, scavenge, craft, and gather resources</strong> for your family's survival. <br><br>Using a <strong>unique blend of survival and colony management mechanics</strong>, you will have to form a community both to survive and find help for your daughter. <strong>Build and manage your community</strong>, protect your people from danger, and make tough decisions that will determine the fate of your group in a harsh and unforgiving world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.poster.avif?t=1752041458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.webm?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/0f970ec0316d737e5cac011c9abbeb6c.mp4?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    <strong>Challenging Survival:</strong> Scavenge, craft, and outsmart the harsh wilderness in a dangerous world with scarce resources.<br></li><li>    <strong>Unforgiving Combat:</strong> No health packs; use bandages to stop bleeding, sleep to heal injuries, and maintain weapons for reliability.<br></li><li>    <strong>Community Management:</strong> Join a survivor community, upgrade your base with  facilities, and create renewable resources to support your people.<br></li><li>    <strong>NPC Companions</strong>: Form bonds with fellow survivors while scavenging for vital supplies and getting to know your community.<br></li><li>    <strong>Skill Progression:</strong> Hone survival skills in the wilderness, improve with every challenge, and master the art of survival.<br></li><li>    <strong>Two Modes Of Play:</strong> Story and Survival. Experience a narrative in Story mode, then test your skills in the post-apocalyptic world alone or with a companion.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.poster.avif?t=1752041458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.webm?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/f9fb08650b4eac0bdde38da7fabcca0f.mp4?t=1752041458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/8600ab9d0b28be5752ea4fde52a9f86b.avif?t=1752041458\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    <strong>Form a Community:</strong> Recruit survivors to create a safe haven.<br></li><li>    <strong>Supply Runs:</strong> Gather food, water, and medicine for survival.<br></li><li>    <strong>Building and Resources:</strong> Construct facilities, create renewable resources.<br></li><li>    <strong>Uncover Missions:</strong> Get intel from recruits, advance the story to help your daughter.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387670/extras/09a4136a2ef9d7372966d8